    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐμοιρ-ίτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ρῑ],
